+// 0.36.2 Milestone 2: the dashboard's window-lifecycle and guided-recovery flow in a real browser (Playwright/Chromium) against a
+// FAKE desktop host on the host's own origin. The fake driver answers like the real one: a closed window is window-gone, a restarted
